{"path":"chrono/month_weekday_last/operator_cmp","title":"std::chrono::operator==(std::chrono::month_weekday_last)","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::chrono::</span>operator==<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">(std::chrono::month_weekday_last)</span>","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/chrono/month_weekday_last/operator_cmp","section":"chrono","kind":"page","summary":"Compares the two month_weekday_last values x and y.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/chrono\">&lt;chrono&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> operator<span class=\"sy1\">==</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/month_weekday_last\"><span class=\"kw2605\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">month_weekday_last</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> x, <br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/month_weekday_last\"><span class=\"kw2605\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">month_weekday_last</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> y <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Compares the two <code>month_weekday_last</code> values <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">x</span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-c